# services/
# This directory will contain the business logic layer (service classes/functions).
# Services sit between the route handlers and the database models,
# keeping routes thin and logic testable.
# Planned service modules:
#   auth_service.py        → login, token creation, password reset
#   user_service.py        → user CRUD operations
#   student_service.py     → student enrollment, profile management
#   teacher_service.py     → teacher assignment, profile management
#   class_service.py       → class creation, enrollment management
#   attendance_service.py  → mark attendance, generate summaries
#   grade_service.py       → submit grades, calculate averages, generate reports
#   announcement_service.py → publish and manage announcements
